This is a copy of 'lz4.h/c' and 'lz4hc.h/c' from the LZ4 [1] repository
(release v1.10.0) and of 'xxhash.h' from the xxHash [2] repository (release
v0.8.3). Why a copy and not a Git submodule? The reason is the odd licensing
policy of lz4: it uses multiple licenses for different parts of the repository.
To be on the safe side, this is a copy of the strictly BSD-licensed
implementation portions.

[1] https://github.com/lz4/lz4
[2] https://github.com/Cyan4973/xxHash
